    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes &amp; Shots is a Roguelite Shooter Bullet-hell , where you can control time as you make your way through a twisted and delusional universe. Your enemies will merge, creating infinite combinations to try to overwhelm you: only your skills, combined with the variety of upgrades you choose, can lead you to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353800/extras/4240f55c59fd67a8fc373dcfd854fef3.avif?t=1730056559\" /></span>When it gets tough out there and you realize there is no cover, or when you are about to be overwhelmed by a barrage of bullets... Stop everything, take a deep breath, and reposition yourself behind the enemies. Unload all your might against them and turn the tide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353800/extras/b3eb4f1541b884d75a2b3b64acf6de7a.avif?t=1730056559\" /></span>In this universe, enemies can merge, combine the power of their weapons, and gain unique characteristics. Take care of them before they realize that unity is strength. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353800/extras/3c3c06ae7e008dde12754588546268f2.avif?t=1730056559\" /></span>Challenges will increase: you must level up to increase your base characteristics. Choose whether to enhance the ability to control time or to increase mobility and damage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that is not all. In your climb to victory, you will find many chests that will grant you access to unique game-changing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
